{"info": {"address1": "A-107-108, Sector-IV", "address2": "Distt. Gautam Budh Nagar", "city": "Noida", "zip": "201301", "country": "India", "phone": "91 12 0401 2345", "fax": "91 12 0255 6040", "website": "https://www.uflexltd.com", "industry": "Packaging & Containers", "industryKey": "packaging-containers", "industryDisp": "Packaging & Containers", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "Uflex Limited manufactures and sells flexible packaging materials and solutions in Indiaand internationally. It operates through Flexible Packaging Activities, Engineering Activities, and Others segments. The company offers bi-axially oriented polyethylene terephthalate films; bi-axially oriented polypropylene films; cast polypropylene films; metallized films; special effects films; and alox coated films. It also provides primers, water-based flexo and gravure inks, radiation-curable inks, solvent based inks, topcoats, heat seal coatings, barrier coatings for replacements, water-based blister coatings, energy curable and UV coatings, solvent-based matt and gloss coatings, UV LED coatings, and other products, as well as solvent-based, solvent-free and water-based laminating adhesives. In addition, it offers packaging materials, and filling machines. Further, it provides holograms, holographic films, textile value addition products, and holographic metalized papers and board transfers solutions. Additionally, it provides flexible laminates, pre-formed pouches, flexo printed rolls and bags, laminated woven poly propylene bags, electron beam and cast n cure packaging products, pharmaceuticals packing products, flexitubes, hygiene films, modified atmosphere packaging products, shower proof bags, and injection moulding products, as well as N-95 masks. It also offers gravure cylinders, flexo plates, and flexo printing sleeves; and packaging and converting machines, as well as specialty products. Uflex Limited was founded in 1983 and is based in Noida, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 7619, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashok Kumar Chaturvedi B.Sc.", "age": 69, "title": "Executive Chairman & MD", "yearBorn": 1956, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 156449000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jeevaraj Gopal Pillai", "age": 64, "title": "Whole-Time Director, Director of Sustainability & President of Flexi. Pack. and New Prod. Devl.", "yearBorn": 1961, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 17878000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Apoorvshree  Chaturvedi", "title": "Director of Global Operations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. H. M. Raje M.Chem.Engg.", "age": 69, "title": "Vice President of Technology", "yearBorn": 1956, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Surajit  Pal", "title": "Vice President of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Dinesh  Jain B.Sc. LLB, DBA, LLM", "age": 71, "title": "President of Legal & Corporate Affairs", "yearBorn": 1954, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ritesh  Chaudhry", "title": "Senior Vice President of Secretarial, Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anant Pal Singh B.Pharma", "age": 78, "title": "President of Group Coordination & Marketing", "yearBorn": 1947, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Chandan  Chattaraj B.Com, Pgdm(Ir&Pm)", "age": 61, "title": "President of Human Resources - India & Global", "yearBorn": 1964, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Subhash  Khatua", "title": "Deputy General Manager